+    # of the same order as the equivalent wye-delta grounding bank (YNd) -- but
+    # not identical, since the zigzag presents only its own HV-winding leakage
+    # portion to earth (si0), per the YNzn zero-sequence model.
+    assert znyn_mv > 0.0
